49:36.696 --> 49:39.216
Mari, semua ambil gambar.

49:42.104 --> 49:44.449
♪Bila angin musim panas bertiup♪

49:44.824 --> 49:45.853
Lihat ke kamera.

49:47.416 --> 49:48.056
Tiga.

49:50.168 --> 49:51.115
Dua.

49:51.928 --> 49:53.104
Satu.

49:56.472 --> 50:01.155
♪Kau seperti payung,
